          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "Layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Ch2\u003EWhat is Umbraco Engage?\u003C/h2\u003E\u003Cp\u003EFormally known as uMarketingSuite, Umbraco Engage is a suite of essential digital marketing tools built for the Umbraco platform, turning the CMS into a fully-fledged digital experience platform (DXP).\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EUsing Umbraco Engage brings core capabilities including analytics, A/B testing, personalisation and profiling to Umbraco.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Ch2\u003EWe are an Umbraco Engage reseller\u003C/h2\u003E\u003Cp\u003E3chillies has been a uMarketingSuite (and now Umbraco Engage) reseller since 2022, supporting marketing teams who use the excellent Umbraco CMS, but desire a more complete digital experience solution.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Ch2\u003EWhy we love working with Umbraco Engage\u003C/h2\u003E\u003Cp\u003EUmbraco is an exceptional open-source CMS loved by developers for its flexibility and by marketing teams for its intuitive interfaces. Powerful add-ons such as Engage transform Umbraco into a feature-rich and flexible platform.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EEngage is packed with must-have digital marketing tools including A/B testing, 360 degrees profiling, lead-scoring, Umbraco analytics, personalisation, and marketing automation.\u003C/p\u003E"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
